# Mosquitto ACL — per-user topic grants (LAN threat model).
#
# Deployment notes (Gate 0):
#   - The `esp32` user does NOT exist in the shipped passwd yet — it must be
#     created at deployment time via `mosquitto_passwd -b mosquitto/config/passwd
#     esp32 <secret>` (dedicated firmware credential; removes direct relay
#     control from the shared pipeline credential). The firmware's secrets.h
#     must carry the same pair.
#   - `ems_api` exists in the passwd file but is UNUSED: docker-compose
#     connects the API container as ems_pipeline. Left in place intentionally;
#     if it is ever wired up, give it ems_pipeline's grants minus command writes.
#     (Do NOT give it zero permissions silently — delete it instead.)

user esp32
topic read home/plug/+/command
topic write home/sensor/+/power
topic write home/sensor/+/telemetry
topic write home/sensor/+/status
topic write home/plug/+/ack

user ems_pipeline
topic read home/sensor/#
topic read home/ui/events
topic read home/plug/+/command
topic read home/plug/+/ack
topic read home/ml/label
topic read $SYS/#
topic write home/plug/+/command
topic write home/ui/events
topic write home/ml/label
